{
  "name": "AI Chief of Staff — ProFollowUp_TEMPLATE",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "wh",
      "name": "Webhook (test)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        -120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "path": "acos-pro-followup",
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "responseMode": "lastNode"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ewt",
      "name": "When Called by Dispatcher",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        0,
        120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "inputSource": "passthrough"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "norm",
      "name": "Normalize Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        280,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "a1",
              "name": "transcript",
              "value": "={{ $json.body?.transcript ?? $json.transcript }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a2",
              "name": "meeting_id",
              "value": "={{ $json.body?.meeting_id ?? $json.meeting_id }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a3",
              "name": "run_id",
              "value": "={{ $json.body?.run_id ?? $json.run_id }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a4",
              "name": "tenant_id",
              "value": "={{ $json.body?.tenant_id ?? $json.tenant_id }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "model",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        280,
        220
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "gpt-4o-mini",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "gpt-4o-mini"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "agent",
      "name": "Draft Follow-up",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        560,
        0
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 2,
      "waitBetweenTries": 4000,
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Meeting transcript:\n\n{{ $json.transcript }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are the AI Chief of Staff for the operator running this workflow. You are given the full transcript of a client meeting the operator ran. Draft a professional, concise follow-up message the operator can send to the client after the meeting. Summarise what was discussed, confirm the agreed next steps with their owners, and end with a clear call to action. Keep it warm but business-like. Write in the same language as the transcript. Output only the message text, ready to send — no preamble and no commentary.\n\n// {{REPLACE_ME_FOLLOWUP_SYSTEM_PROMPT}}: customize this prompt to your voice. Add the operator's name, company, positioning, and any forbidden phrases. Three sharp examples of past follow-ups you wrote yourself beat any adjectives — paste them below."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fmt",
      "name": "Format Output",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        840,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "o1",
              "name": "output",
              "value": "={{ $json.output }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "o2",
              "name": "model",
              "value": "gpt-4o-mini",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sticky-readme",
      "name": "README",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI Chief of Staff — ProFollowUp_TEMPLATE\n\n**Was dieser Sub-Workflow tut.** Wird vom Dispatcher mit `{transcript, meeting_id, run_id, tenant_id}` aufgerufen, generiert mit GPT-4o-mini einen höflichen Follow-up-Text zum Meeting, gibt `{output, model}` zurück.\n\n**Was du einsetzen musst:** OpenAI-Credential im `OpenAI Chat Model`-Node. Optional: passe den System-Prompt in `Draft Follow-up` an deine Stimme an (siehe Sticky-Note dort).\n\n**Wichtig:** Der `Webhook (test)`-Trigger ist Absicht. n8n's `Execute Workflow` braucht für inaktive Sub-Workflows einen aktiven Trigger im Sub-Workflow. Lass den Webhook drin und aktiviere den Workflow.\n\n> [!success] Komplett native\n> Dieser Sub-Workflow nutzt ausschließlich native n8n-Nodes (Edit Fields + LangChain Agent). Keine Code-Nodes.",
        "height": 160,
        "width": 1180,
        "color": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sticky-trigger",
      "name": "Entry Points",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Entry Points\n**When Called by Dispatcher**: der echte Eingang, wenn der Dispatcher diesen Workflow ruft.\n\n**Webhook (test)**: nur als Hilfs-Trigger, damit n8n den Workflow aktiv hält. Nicht weiter verkabelt.",
        "height": 160,
        "width": 240,
        "color": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sticky-llm",
      "name": "LLM",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        220,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## LLM\n**OpenAI Chat Model** liefert das LLM. Default: gpt-4o-mini. Du kannst auf jedes Modell wechseln, das deine Credentials erlauben (gpt-4o, gpt-4.1, claude, etc.). **Draft Follow-up** ist der LangChain Agent — System-Prompt = deine Customization. Default-Prompt ist generic; ersetze die Platzhalter mit deiner Stimme + 2-3 Beispielen.",
        "height": 160,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sticky-out",
      "name": "Output",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        780,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Output\n**Format Output** gibt `{output, model}` an den Dispatcher zurück. Der Dispatcher übernimmt das Logging in `runs`.",
        "height": 160,
        "width": 240,
        "color": 5
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook (test)": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Normalize Input",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "When Called by Dispatcher": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Normalize Input",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Normalize Input": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Draft Follow-up",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "OpenAI Chat Model": {
      "ai_languageModel": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Draft Follow-up",
            "type": "ai_languageModel",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Draft Follow-up": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Format Output",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "callerPolicy": "workflowsFromSameOwner"
  }
}
